<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Ahold lowered at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ahold lowered at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch supermarket group Ahold NV was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer,&quot; the investment bank Goldman Sachs said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
